      "content": "thanks for this. it's a good start and definitely sounds professional. \n\ni just ran this draft through a mock version of their scoring tool to see how i'm doing, and the score is actually kind of low—it's only at like 6 or 7. i'm worried that if it's not much higher than that, the recruiter won't even see it.\n\ncan you try a second version? i still really need it to sound like a real person wrote it and tell that story about my internship, but could you find more ways to weave those values into the text? try to get that count up significantly so the score is much higher, but please keep it sounding natural and avoid just listing them like a grocery list.",
      "source": "evaluator"
